      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "6b1de2e5-536b-5673-b2c0-0f81cf838865",
      "content": "헤헤, 팀이니까요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Hehe, we're a team.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e7e4bb9b-0892-5832-b5b2-c6e1dba36cf0",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 170.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "6b1de2e5-536b-5673-b2c0-0f81cf838865",
      "content": "당연하죠. 내일은 제 차례예요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Of course. Tomorrow's my turn.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "cbbc0651-8be3-51a9-9d67-9721420a63a4": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "001c5f18-6d2f-5f9e-8285-38c08d5cfb78",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 170.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "6b1de2e5-536b-5673-b2c0-0f81cf838865",
      "content": "…그런 말 하시면 부담돼요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "...Saying that puts pressure on me.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
